- Extended the invoked Java `MqClientAdmin` fixture with success and Nameserver
  error cases; added scripted Core tests comparing request code/fields and
  response code/remark. Code commit `fb1e43b5`:
  `feat(admin): add delete topic in nameserver RPC`.
- The source-backed `MqClientAdmin` inventory now has 8 of 19 methods
  reconciled. Updated the Phase 17 matrix and release checklist; Phase 18 plan
  remains unchanged.
- Preserved the pre-existing uncommitted Phase 19 README, differential runner,
  local runner, and its execution log; none were included in this slice.

